 NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...
 SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...
 ```
+
+## 7. Multiple kiosks
+
+See [MULTI_KIOSK.md](./MULTI_KIOSK.md) — the schema above already includes
+`kiosk_id`, so adding kiosks later is just configuration, no code changes.
